1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,700
Long ago, a ring of islands rose from fire and sea.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,700
At its heart grows the World-Tree. Its golden sap colors all things.

3
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,700
But the old kings bled that sap into the sea.

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:19,700
Now a grey tide rises. All it touches forgets its color… and its name.

5
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,700
Only Embershore still glows. And tonight, the grey has reached its orchards.

6
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,200
Wake up, steward.
